<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Non-functional_testing" title="Non-functional testing">Non-functional testing</a><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span>– Testing the qualities as opposed to the correctness of software</li>
